If a clinician does not provably understand a transdermal-fentanyl-dosing then it is recommended that the clinician does not consider a transdermal-fentanyl-prescription.
If a clinician does not provably understand a transdermal-fentanyl-absorption then it is recommended that the clinician does not consider a transdermal-fentanyl-prescription.
If a clinician does not provably prepare a patient-education then it is recommended that the clinician does not consider a transdermal-fentanyl-prescription.
